  "credits": "Cueva de Xcaret, Quintana Roo, Mexico. Survey by NSS Cave Diving Section, Association for Mexican Cave Studies, August 1979: Ned DeLoach, Karan Exley, Sheck Exley (surface features after Andrews, 1975). Floor depths in metres. Property of Sr. Felipe Delgado. Published in Caving International Magazine 8, p. 39, 1980; AMCS Activities Newsletter 32, p. 103, 2009",
